WEBVTT

00:02.073 --> 00:07.990
Y-you idiot! I said turn on the lights
and back off, didn't I?

00:13.406 --> 00:14.698
Huh? You all, too?

00:15.115 --> 00:16.490
Must be fate.

00:16.490 --> 00:19.365
We all showed up here by coincidence.

00:19.365 --> 00:21.615
But it's fun to be all together like this!

00:22.073 --> 00:24.156
Yagami, have you read the script?

00:24.156 --> 00:27.156
That's why we're all here, isn't it?

00:28.115 --> 00:30.906
I wanted to clean up before the shoot starts.

00:31.490 --> 00:35.865
This episode's script kind of reads
like a dirty fanboy wrote it, though.

00:36.448 --> 00:38.990
Takahashi-sensei must be
pushing us into new territory.

00:38.990 --> 00:41.031
New territory, huh?

00:41.781 --> 00:44.448
I'll have to try even harder!

00:45.698 --> 00:47.740
Yeah, new territory.

00:47.740 --> 00:50.156
Let your punishment for toying
with a man's pure feelings...

00:50.156 --> 00:52.740
be inscribed upon your very bodies!

00:54.948 --> 00:56.365
Uh-oh!

01:03.781 --> 01:08.490
If I should get invited by you

01:08.490 --> 01:10.406
There's no way he will

01:10.406 --> 01:15.031
We'll start off with a kiss

01:15.198 --> 01:17.115
I won't allow it

01:17.115 --> 01:21.823
Just the two of us in one room

01:21.823 --> 01:23.740
Stop right there!

01:23.740 --> 01:28.823
I want to become an adult

01:28.823 --> 01:30.240
Because I love you so much

01:30.240 --> 01:32.365
That's just your imagination

01:30.241 --> 01:32.365
Because I love you so much

01:32.365 --> 01:33.573
That's just your imagination

01:32.366 --> 01:33.573
Oh, he can have it

01:33.573 --> 01:35.656
He belongs to me

01:33.574 --> 01:35.656
Oh, he can have it

01:35.656 --> 01:36.865
He belongs to me

01:35.657 --> 01:36.865
All of me

01:36.865 --> 01:38.990
There's nothing to you on the inside

01:36.866 --> 01:38.990
All of me

01:38.990 --> 01:40.198
There's nothing to you on the inside

01:38.991 --> 01:40.198
That hidden charm

01:40.198 --> 01:42.198
Don't butt in

01:40.199 --> 01:42.198
That hidden charm

01:42.198 --> 01:43.823
Is infinite

01:43.823 --> 01:47.323
This isn't who I usually am

01:47.323 --> 01:50.281
Not her! Look at my charms!

01:50.281 --> 01:53.615
The real me

01:53.615 --> 01:55.615
Is what I want him to see

01:53.616 --> 01:55.615
Is what I want him to see

01:55.615 --> 01:56.906
Because I love you so much

01:56.906 --> 01:58.823
That's just a dream you're having

01:56.907 --> 01:58.823
Because I love you so much

01:58.823 --> 02:00.198
That's just a dream you're having

01:58.824 --> 02:00.198
You can even touch

02:00.198 --> 02:02.156
He belongs to me

02:00.199 --> 02:02.156
You can even touch

02:02.156 --> 02:03.615
He belongs to me

02:02.157 --> 02:03.615
My trembling breast

02:03.615 --> 02:05.365
Your breast isn't even that impressive

02:03.616 --> 02:05.365
My trembling breast

02:05.365 --> 02:06.948
Your breast isn't even that impressive

02:05.366 --> 02:06.948
With dreams and courage

02:06.948 --> 02:08.865
Don't make me laugh

02:06.949 --> 02:08.865
With dreams and courage

02:08.865 --> 02:09.573
Don't make me laugh

02:08.866 --> 02:09.573
We'll be joined

02:09.573 --> 02:10.448
We'll be joined

02:10.448 --> 02:13.115
I will become

02:13.115 --> 02:13.740
No, I will become

02:13.116 --> 02:13.740
I will become

02:13.740 --> 02:15.240
No, I will become

02:13.741 --> 02:15.240
Your number one

02:15.240 --> 02:20.240
Your number one

02:15.241 --> 02:20.240
Your number one

02:29.323 --> 02:32.156
THE MAN WHO KNEW TOO MUCH

02:33.448 --> 02:36.698
I'm sick of wearing this thing.

02:38.865 --> 02:42.906
Why give them a free show if
no one even looks at you?

02:44.073 --> 02:46.156
Takahara-sensei?!

02:47.240 --> 02:49.406
So, what did he say?

02:49.823 --> 02:51.656
He just called.

02:51.656 --> 02:54.115
He seemed to think the plot
foundations are all right,

02:54.115 --> 02:57.948
be he seemed really worried about
problems with the subject matter.

02:58.323 --> 03:02.073
Cruce being resurrected as a villain
was planned from the start,

03:02.073 --> 03:04.990
as was revealing his evil schemes as a plot twist,

03:04.990 --> 03:08.031
and I suppose depicting that is going
to be a little hardcore, but...

03:09.198 --> 03:11.281
There have been all sorts of things
cropping up lately.

03:11.615 --> 03:13.865
The world can be a hard place.

03:14.198 --> 03:16.698
Then I can just rewrite it, can't I?!

03:17.906 --> 03:20.406
Just order me to, as our great producer!

03:21.490 --> 03:22.615
Now, wait a minute!

03:22.615 --> 03:27.115
Anyway, I'll rewrite the plot as many times
as it takes till you get the best ending!

03:27.656 --> 03:30.906
Don't go giving up on me now!

03:31.990 --> 03:34.531
I can't turn back now.

03:35.240 --> 03:37.490
We just have to keep shooting!

03:37.948 --> 03:41.906
This is my revenge on these girls
who have been toying with me!

03:43.823 --> 03:46.990
Revenge? He wouldn't...

04:02.781 --> 04:06.240
Ooizumi... He came today.

04:11.948 --> 04:15.990
You're first... Youko Katsuragi!

04:21.281 --> 04:23.531
The whip's going to be hitting me lightly.

04:23.531 --> 04:25.656
I have to act like it really hurts.

04:26.240 --> 04:29.823
I need to move in sync with the wires
the stagehands will be pulling.

04:33.323 --> 04:34.281
Here it comes!

04:45.156 --> 04:48.490
NO!

04:49.281 --> 04:49.531
What happened?! Stop! Don't look!

04:49.531 --> 04:51.198
Gotcha!

04:49.532 --> 04:51.198
What happened?! Stop! Don't look!

04:51.198 --> 04:54.240
What happened?! Stop! Don't look!

04:54.240 --> 04:58.531
Let me down! No!

05:17.781 --> 05:18.740
Divine punishment.

05:21.031 --> 05:23.698
I feel sorry for Hikaru.

05:23.698 --> 05:26.323
They said they're trying to make
it as real as possible here,

05:26.323 --> 05:28.906
and since they seem to have made
that warm water all muddy,

05:28.906 --> 05:31.156
it's hard for her to breathe out under water.

05:33.323 --> 05:35.573
Terrible taste.

05:35.573 --> 05:40.781
Matching the pattern on your panties and
your sanitary napkin's even worse taste!

05:52.990 --> 05:56.365
An appropriate situation for
someone with a fear of heights!

06:21.865 --> 06:23.865
Now do you understand?

06:27.740 --> 06:30.115
I'm a little bruised.

06:32.031 --> 06:34.573
Are you okay? Does it hurt?

06:34.573 --> 06:37.865
Not a bit! It's nothing compared
to what you went through.

06:38.781 --> 06:40.156
Ow, ow, ow...

06:40.615 --> 06:43.740
I hope they don't stay permanently.

06:44.365 --> 06:46.615
I can't get this slime off of my skin.

06:46.865 --> 06:49.990
Looks like everyone got a lot taken out of them.

06:49.990 --> 06:52.865
Yeah. I'm kind of spent, now.

06:55.531 --> 06:58.698
I wonder if this is all my fault.

06:58.698 --> 07:01.698
Looks like they're doing Natsumi's shots now.

07:02.031 --> 07:05.740
I heard Yazawa say before
that they may take till tonight.

07:06.240 --> 07:09.781
The script says she gets tortured with slime.

07:10.240 --> 07:12.865
Most of it's going to be a CG composite shot,

07:12.865 --> 07:15.448
but the set's closed to everyone
except a small crew.

07:16.448 --> 07:18.698
I don't want to think much about what it'll be like.

07:34.865 --> 07:36.573
A-amazing.

07:37.365 --> 07:40.198
I mean, this is so satisfying!

07:40.198 --> 07:44.490
Making an embarrassing spectacle
of herself in front of everyone!

07:49.865 --> 07:51.531
Yagami.

07:52.740 --> 07:54.240
Good job.

07:54.240 --> 07:57.490
Ooizumi! It's been so long!

07:59.031 --> 08:00.656
The devil's cuteness!

08:01.031 --> 08:04.656
S-so, how do you think I did today?

08:04.656 --> 08:07.531
You were great! Really appealing!

08:08.865 --> 08:11.240
What is with the cutesy act?!

08:11.240 --> 08:15.781
You're just being sexy to try and
lure me in, aren't you?!

08:16.156 --> 08:19.865
I thought I might have been overdoing it a little.

08:20.365 --> 08:25.115
But since you say you liked it,
I'll just try that much harder!

08:26.115 --> 08:27.990
S-sure...

08:30.948 --> 08:32.781
Good night!

08:35.781 --> 08:38.156
Is that smile all an act, too?

08:38.573 --> 08:40.031
It has to be!

08:40.031 --> 08:43.573
I'll turn that smile into wails of despair!

08:43.865 --> 08:46.365
Ooizumi, are you free later?

08:47.490 --> 08:50.573
I'd like you to wait for me while I shower.

08:50.573 --> 08:52.740
We haven't seen each other in a while,

08:52.740 --> 08:54.906
and there're all sorts of things
I'd like to talk about.

08:54.906 --> 08:57.156
Trying that trick again?

08:57.156 --> 08:59.990
Sorry. I have to edit today's footage.

09:00.406 --> 09:01.948
Oh, I see...

09:01.948 --> 09:04.156
Well, see you in school tomorrow.

09:04.615 --> 09:06.490
Good work today.

09:06.490 --> 09:08.031
And you.

09:10.240 --> 09:12.490
I won't be fooled anymore.

09:14.281 --> 09:15.781
Hello?

09:15.781 --> 09:16.865
Ooizumi.

09:17.656 --> 09:19.281
Ikita?

09:19.281 --> 09:21.448
It's about the plot.

09:21.823 --> 09:26.031
Do you have any special feelings
for Yagami and the others?

09:27.156 --> 09:29.323
A grudge, for example?

09:30.490 --> 09:34.740
This episode's script almost seemed
like you were venting your anger.

09:36.615 --> 09:41.406
I'm at a costume-fitting session right now,
so could you come to the waiting room?

09:41.948 --> 09:44.781
I'd like to have a talk with you there.

09:46.323 --> 09:47.990
She knows!

09:47.990 --> 09:51.073
Well, I'll deal with it when I deal with it!

09:53.573 --> 09:55.406
Excuse me...?

09:57.573 --> 10:00.073
There's no costume-fitting going on here.

10:03.198 --> 10:04.698
Ooizumi.

10:05.281 --> 10:07.115
Ikita...?

10:12.740 --> 10:14.656
I-Imamura!

10:17.865 --> 10:18.823
Why...?

10:22.490 --> 10:25.198
Was that you who just called me?!

10:25.198 --> 10:26.698
Ooizumi...

10:27.740 --> 10:31.073
You can do whatever you want to me.

10:35.531 --> 10:38.115
It's okay. I don't mind.

10:38.448 --> 10:40.365
What's "okay" about it?!

10:41.031 --> 10:45.781
That's right. You don't like me, do you?

10:45.781 --> 10:49.156
Okay. I'll sound like Natsumi when I cry out.

10:49.156 --> 10:50.656
Then you'll like it.

10:50.656 --> 10:52.823
D-don't be ridiculous!

10:52.823 --> 10:56.198
Just stop taking it out on everyone else!

10:57.531 --> 11:01.740
You can do whatever you want to me,

10:57.532 --> 11:01.740
in their place.

11:01.740 --> 11:05.865
What do you want from me?
Should I take these off?

11:06.740 --> 11:08.740
S-stop it!

11:08.740 --> 11:12.073
Because I'm the one who made you do all that.

11:12.073 --> 11:13.865
Made me do it?

11:13.865 --> 11:15.615
Wh-what are you doing?!

11:20.031 --> 11:24.073
All I had to do was give him some loving
looks and I had him wrapped around my finger.

11:24.865 --> 11:28.531
There's no way he'd ever honestly look at me.

11:31.031 --> 11:34.031
I'm always here with you...

11:34.031 --> 11:36.906
Always giving you all the signals,

11:37.698 --> 11:39.823
but you never even looked at me.

11:40.698 --> 11:43.323
It was all your trick?!

11:43.323 --> 11:47.281
But I can't stand to see you
being so cruel anymore.

11:47.823 --> 11:50.073
It was... all a lie?

11:50.073 --> 11:53.240
About Yagami... and Katsuragi?

11:53.781 --> 11:56.448
We all knew you were writing the show!

11:57.156 --> 12:01.031
No... You were all tricking me all along!

12:01.490 --> 12:02.781
That's...!

12:02.781 --> 12:07.448
I won't stop! Because
you all were tricking me first!

12:10.281 --> 12:13.698
I won't stop! I'll make them apologize to me!

12:53.781 --> 12:59.115
You might notice, as I peep through the viewfinder

12:59.406 --> 13:02.323
That you're the only one

13:02.323 --> 13:06.240
That I was following

13:06.865 --> 13:09.698
Bit by bit, our time together

13:09.698 --> 13:12.906
Starts to overlap

13:13.740 --> 13:16.115
And these feelings I can't hide

13:16.115 --> 13:19.906
Don't have to be hidden anymore

13:20.740 --> 13:24.198
Like the moon and the stars long ago

13:24.198 --> 13:26.823
Once promised

13:27.573 --> 13:31.115
The two of us will always

13:31.115 --> 13:34.823
Be connected

13:34.906 --> 13:38.156
Stronger than anyone, closer than anyone

13:38.156 --> 13:41.615
Yes, I'm here to love you

13:41.865 --> 13:45.198
In my eyes and in my heart

13:45.198 --> 13:48.448
You blaze for me

13:48.573 --> 13:51.906
Even if the winds blow and the rains fall

13:52.115 --> 13:55.365
I'll stay with you, as long as we're together

13:55.490 --> 13:58.990
Yesterday, surely, tomorrow, even moreso

13:58.990 --> 14:02.865
You'll be that much dearer to me

14:08.823 --> 14:23.865
NEXT
EPISODE

14:11.281 --> 14:12.823
Help me!

14:14.115 --> 14:18.073
This is the sort of road everyone
has to cross if they want to be an actor.

14:19.531 --> 14:23.031
You did mine, so we're even, now.
